<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .status { font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 4px; }
        .approved { background-color: #d4edda; color: #155724; }
        .rejected { background-color: #f8d7da; color: #721c24; }
        .footer { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Update on your Instructor Application</h2>
        <p>Hello,</p>

        <p>Your KYC verification request for <strong>Flying Class</strong> has been reviewed.</p>

        {{#if isApproved}}
            <div class="status approved">Status: APPROVED</div>
            <p>Congratulations! Your account has been upgraded. You can now start creating courses and managing your students.</p>
            <p><a href="http://localhost:3000/instructor/dashboard">Go to Instructor Dashboard</a></p>
        {{else}}
            <div class="status rejected">Status: REJECTED</div>
            <p>Unfortunately, your application was not approved for the following reason:</p>
            <blockquote style="border-left: 4px solid #f5c6cb; padding-left: 15px; font-style: italic;">
                "{{reason}}"
            </blockquote>
            <p>You can re-submit your documents through the profile settings page after addressing the issue mentioned above.</p>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Best regards,<br>The Flying Class Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
